WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.601 --> 00:00:25.627
The next morning a trumpet blew loudly.

2
00:00:25.628 --> 00:00:29.316
"A royal messenger!" Stepmother cried.

3
00:00:29.317 --> 00:00:35.660
Stepmother and her daughters ran outside.

4
00:00:35.661 --> 00:00:41.873
Cinderella wiped her hands on her apron.

5
00:00:41.874 --> 00:00:46.491
Then she followed them.

6
00:00:46.492 --> 00:00:51.227
"I wonder what the message is," she thought.

7
00:00:51.228 --> 00:00:53.869
A big crowd was outside.

8
00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:57.381
The royal messenger sat on a horse.

9
00:00:57.382 --> 00:01:00.375
He held a long piece of paper.

10
00:01:00.376 --> 00:01:02.705
"Ahem!" the messenger said.

11
00:01:02.706 --> 00:01:05.463
"This is a very important message.

12
00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:07.847
The prince is hosting a ball.

13
00:01:07.848 --> 00:01:11.187
All fine ladies in the kingdom are invited."

14
00:01:11.188 --> 00:01:15.712
"Ooh!" several ladies said at once.

15
00:01:15.713 --> 00:01:19.176
Cinderella's stepsisters clapped with delight.

16
00:01:19.177 --> 00:01:23.212
"We're going to the prince's ball!" Gert cried.

17
00:01:23.213 --> 00:01:25.197
Trudy's eyes lit up.

18
00:01:25.198 --> 00:01:28.731
"This is so exciting!" she said.

19
00:01:28.732 --> 00:01:32.128
"Maybe the prince will ask me to marry him!"

20
00:01:32.129 --> 00:01:36.060
Gert snorted. "No way, Trudy.

21
00:01:36.061 --> 00:01:38.994
The prince will fall in love with me!

22
00:01:38.995 --> 00:01:43.625
I'm beautiful and tall."

23
00:01:43.626 --> 00:01:45.932
Trudy put her hands on her hips.

24
00:01:45.933 --> 00:01:54.821
"Well, I'm beautiful and . . . plump!"

25
00:01:54.822 --> 00:01:57.988
"Girls, girls," Stepmother said.

26
00:01:57.989 --> 00:02:01.231
"You're both beautiful."

27
00:02:01.232 --> 00:02:04.887
"A ball," Cinderella said softly.

28
00:02:04.888 --> 00:02:07.953
"There will be music and dancing.

29
00:02:07.954 --> 00:02:10.645
It will be so much fun."

30
00:02:10.646 --> 00:02:16.337
"Ha-ha! Cinderella!" Stepmother laughed loudly.

31
00:02:16.338 --> 00:02:19.206
"You're not going to the ball.

32
00:02:19.207 --> 00:02:24.755
You are not a fine lady!"
